{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12321","headline":"津梁寺寻李侍御 · 钱起","name":"津梁寺寻李侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禅林绝过客，柱史正焚香。\n驯鸽不猜隼，慈云能护霜。\n骢声隔暗竹，吏事散空廊。\n霄汉期鸳鹭，狐狸避宪章。\n遶堦春色至，屈草待君芳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12321.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12321","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}